      "lang": "en",
      "largura": 390,
      "largura_documento": 390,
      "frase": "What this number isIt is the working group’s preliminary estimate of the actuarially neutral reduction for retiring one year early: the reduction that, in the group’s calculations, leaves the person with no expected financial advantage between retiring now and postponing retirement by one year, including contributions no longer paid and pension rights no longer accrued. It is not the statutory early-retirement penalty. The statutory penalty for retiring one year early, excluding the sustainability factor, is about 6 % and is lower than the actuarially neutral reduction of 8,2 %.",
      "marcadores": 0,
